  "extract": "Catherine Helen O'Neil is an American mathematician, data scientist, and author. She is the author of the New York Times best-seller Weapons of Math Destruction, and opinion columns in Bloomberg View. O'Neil was active in the Occupy movement.",
  "extract_html": "<p><b>Catherine Helen O'Neil</b> is an American mathematician, data scientist, and author. She is the author of the <i>New York Times</i> best-seller <i>Weapons of Math Destruction</i>, and opinion columns in Bloomberg View. O'Neil was active in the Occupy movement.</p>"
